    lsp_rename_prepare_rename_not_implemented_2026_11_07, 0, "2026-11-28 p3sweep5: verified at tip - lsp_handle_prepare_rename (lsp_handlers.spl:1355, range+placeholder or JSON null), dispatch (lsp/main.spl:101-103), lsp_query_word_span_at_v1, rename_formatting_spec prepareRename cases PASS, server_capabilities 38/38. The one failing rename example is environmental: SIMPLE_LSP_DEBUG shows the child lsp_query references query killed at the 30s bound (cacheless grandchild JIT of the whole std-lib closure ~38-45s on a loaded box); the same command run directly exits 0 with the exact expected references; deliberately did not bump the fail-closed bound. organizeImports/extract remain open feature requests per the doc. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/app/lsp/rename_formatting_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/app/lsp/server_capabilities_spec.spl"
